# Credentials never enter the repository (Theoria.md Phase 1, sealing discipline).
# The Phase 4 release manifest publishes everything tracked here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Build artefacts — regenerated by `lake build` / `pip install -e .`
.lake/
*.egg-info/
monitor/dispatch-logs/
.claude/settings.local.json
.worktrees/
monitor/refresh.log

# 常驻会话的运行时状态：谁还活着、谁持有哪把锁。**是状态，不是产物。**
# 此前它们既未被跟踪也未被忽略，于是任何一次 `git add -A` 都会顺手把它们
# 扫上主线——游离的 autostash 提交 a9476dd1 里已经有这四个 .lock 作为已跟踪
# 条目。被跟踪之后更糟：一份"谁活着"的快照会随分支来回，读到的是别的机器
# 别的时刻的存活情况，而它长得跟当下的一模一样。
monitor/ops-status/*.lock
monitor/standing_state.json
# The local ARC engine caches every game's SOURCE here on first run, sealed pile
# included. Never committed: the Phase 4 manifest publishes everything tracked,
# and this is ARC's content, not ours. See CLAUDE.md's pile-cut section and
# arc-recon/local_engine_guard.py, which refuses any unfiltered pull.
environment_files/
